+```text
+NEW STAGE-1 SCIENTIFIC BRANCH
+EXACTLY NESTS V39
+ARCHIVES V40/V41 FIRST-ACTION INTERVAL COMPLETION
+REQUIRES EQUIVALENCE16 + COUNTERFACTUAL48 BEFORE ANY PERFORMANCE CLAIM
+```
